B.aty=new A.n1(1,"Awakening",1,18,"You cannot change what you cannot see.","Slow down, name the honest feeling, and notice what keeps returning to your attention.","This phase builds emotional precision. The goal is not to solve everything yet; it is to see yourself clearly enough that change has somewhere to begin.")
B.atA=new A.n1(2,"Excavation",19,36,u.O,"Look beneath the first answer. Trace emotions back to old rules, needs, wounds, and relationships.","This phase helps hidden material surface without judgment. The user is learning what shaped the feeling, not blaming themselves for having it.")
B.atz=new A.n1(3,"Integration",37,54,"What you understand can be held differently.","Reframe rigid stories, hold two truths at once, and let new interpretations become believable.","This phase turns insight into self-compassion. The work is to stop rejecting parts of yourself and begin relating to them with more accuracy.")
B.atC=new A.n1(4,"Renewal",55,72,"A recognized pattern changes a life.","Observe repeated responses across days: triggers, relationship loops, avoidance, self-abandonment, and repair.","This phase makes patterns visible across time. Once the user can recognize a loop early, they can choose a different response.")
B.atB=new A.n1(5,"Rising",73,90,"Self-awareness becomes real when it moves into action.","Choose one honest next step. Practice values, boundaries, repair, rest, and follow-through in daily life.","This phase turns reflection into direction. The user is not proving they are healed; they are practicing living from what they now know.")
B.pa=s([B.aty,B.atA,B.atz,B.atC,B.atB],A.aa("G<n1>"))
